# Copy to .env next to compose.yaml to set these. All are optional.
# JODD_AI_PASSWORD=choose-a-long-password
#   One line. Compose reads $ in this file as a variable: write a literal $ as $$.
#   Applied when it is new or changed; a password you set later with
#   `jodd-ai-host password` is kept across restarts.
# JODD_AI_PORT=2222
# JODD_AI_BIND=0.0.0.0
#   Home LAN: leave as is. VPS or cloud: set a VPN address (e.g. Tailscale) or 127.0.0.1;
#   Docker bypasses ufw/firewalld, so 0.0.0.0 would expose the port to the internet.
